{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん毎年推しのクリスマスが気になってしょうがないのだろう。\n私のクリスマスをお話する～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/12/26/0581399/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆24日イブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆりてぃすと前々から計画してた。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てぃすとデート（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/12/26/0581399/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、\nティム・バートンの世界へ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょいとグロというか\n黒い作品なとこが好き。\nかわいい（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に\nナイトメア・ビフォア・クリスマス\nは高まった、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと行きたかったので良かった～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後は、お買い物（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでイルミネーションもみて♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/12/26/0581399/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの、\nにゃんも合流してお家パーティー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実してたなー♡！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆25日クリスマス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お友達で\nポップティーンのモデルさんの\nゆらゆらと合流してご飯！（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/12/26/0581399/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆらゆらとは\n帰り道バイバイするまでずっと話してて、もっと一緒にいたかった～♡♡\n年下っぽくなくって話しやすいの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人見知りなひなだけど\nなんだか短い時間で\n距離が縮まった気がする！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいクリスマスでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の話になるけど、\nアフィリアさんのライブ行きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなユカフィンさんを\nずーっと目で追って♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/12/26/0581399/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛すぎました！\n幸せです！(´;_;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかユカフィンさんと\nご飯いくんだ～(´,,•ω•,,)♡ふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ感謝祭だね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん来ますか～～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててね（＾ω＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、\n書いてないこと色々あって。笑\n仕事とライブのお話は、\nまた更新しますー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/12/26/0581399/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴょん"}],"source":"archive"}